                  "en": "How long does a programme take?",
                  "ar": "كم تستغرق مدّة البرنامج؟"
                },
                "answer": {
                  "en": "Each programme page shows the total length of its lessons and how many sections and lessons it has. You study at your own pace, so the calendar time is yours to plan.",
